  "evidence": "Nifty's pricing page lists Custom SAML only on the Unlimited plan and never mentions SCIM; the help centre and v3 API reference document SAML apps and a members API but no SCIM endpoint.",
  "notes": "New row. Two pricing modes: flat team plans (Pro $79/mo for 10 members, Business $124/mo for 30, Unlimited $399/mo for unlimited members, billed annually) or per-member plans (Pro $10, Business $16 per member/mo billed annually; monthly $16/$25); Enterprise is contact-us. Google and Microsoft SSO (social sign-in) are on lower plans, but Custom SAML is listed only on Unlimited (the SAML help article says 'Enterprise versions'); setup uses non-gallery/custom Okta and Entra SAML apps. No SCIM in pricing, help centre or API. The v3 REST API (Business and above, so above the Pro team plan: api_tax true) can invite, update, deactivate and restore members and manage roles, with member.* webhooks.",
